    OR ANY JUICE, HOWSOEVER SPILLED.

7.  GENERAL

    7.1  Should any provision of this Licence be held by a tribunal of
         competent jurisdiction to be void, unenforceable, or drafted in
         jest, the remaining provisions shall continue in full force and
         effect, and the Juice shall remain owing as a debt of honour.

    7.2  No failure or delay on the part of the Licensor to notice whether
         any Juice has in fact been conveyed shall operate as a waiver
         thereof.

